<title>USA: Freddie Mac adjusts discount note rates.</title>
<headline>Freddie Mac adjusts discount note rates.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Freddie Mac revised short-term discount note rates Friday as follows:</p>
<p> -		    MATURITY--RATE</p>
<p> -		   Overnight--5.15</p>
<p> -		March 3,5,10--5.22</p>
<p> - March 14,17,24,27,28,31--5.20</p>
<p> -		    April 10--5.20</p>
<p> -	May 23,27,28,29,30--5.21</p>
<p> -			June 2--5.21</p>
<p> -			Aug 29--5.20</p>
<p> -		Feb 27, 1998--5.37</p>
</text>
